      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Adding 5–10 at% Al to FeCoNi and applying solution treatment followed by aging will induce B2-phase formation.",
      "field": "intervention",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC4999872::chunk::003::methods::c1b02d834e",
        "PMC6197204::chunk::000::abstract::a6951d7e3c"
      ],
      "same_system": "unclear"
    },
    {
      "text": "A solution treatment near 1100 °C followed by aging at 600–700 °C for up to 10 hours is an appropriate processing window for producing the proposed B2 phase in Al-doped FeCoNi.",
      "field": "conditions",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The resulting B2 phase will occur as nanoscale precipitates dispersed within an fcc matrix.",
      "field": "structural_mediator",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC4999872::chunk::003::methods::c1b02d834e",
        "PMC6197204::chunk::000::abstract::a6951d7e3c"
      ],
      "same_system": "unclear"
    },
    {
      "text": "B2 nanoprecipitates act as strong domain-wall pinning centers.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Pinning by B2 nanoprecipitates increases resistance to domain-wall motion and thereby enhances coercivity.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The Al-doping and aging intervention will raise coercivity above 200 Oe.",
      "field": "predicted_outcome",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The intervention will produce only a modest reduction in saturation magnetization relative to undoped single-phase fcc FeCoNi.",
      "field": "predicted_outcome",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The proposed effect applies for Al additions up to approximately 10 at%.",
      "field": "boundary",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The coercivity increase requires an appropriate heat treatment.",
